ISO-10303-21;
/* Gn038: BOUNDED_PCURVE('bp_on_plane') in SURFACE_CURVE.associated_geometry; BRL-CAD step-g LoadONBrep stub returns false for BoundedPCurve subtype; trim loses parametric curve, becomes 3D-only, re-projected with drift; compliant kernel must defer to definitional basis curve and reparameterise; OCC silent-accept; See also Gn019, Twi100, Twi101; C-1 break in 3D edge at t=0.5 (1.5-unit CP gap) drives shape_null=True */
